id: pm-github-wzvn
title: Admit GitHub issue mirrors in strict trackers with deferred fields
description: Imported GitHub issues must be admitted on strict-preset trackers without invented required fields.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[4]: changelog-unreleased,"gh:unbraind/pm-github#237",import,sync
created_at: "2026-11-17T18:48:46.783Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T02:17:04.285Z"
author: pi-glm
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-17T18:49:13.074Z",pi-glm,"Root cause: the importer creates new Issues with title, type, description, body, tags, author, status and message only. Strict-preset trackers set create_mode_default to strict, so the SDK requires acceptance criteria, assignee, comment, deadline, dependency, doc, estimate, file, learning, note, priority and test. One refused create rolls back the atomic import. Design: admit new imported items with createMode progressive, and when the SDK records deferrals, defer unknown deadline, assignee, acceptance criteria and estimate with an honest import reason. Never invent those values. Updates keep their current options."
  "2026-11-17T22:45:36.589Z",codex-sol,"Resumed the existing item. Atomic import forwards the create row through the public SDK bulk mutation API. The bundled development SDK types expose createMode, and the published PM CLI 2026.11.17 create contract also exposes defer and deferReason. Verifying the pinned failure and the persisted receipt with the real SDK."
  "2026-11-17T22:47:23.771Z",codex-sol,Reproduced at a3a2e7c using a temporary copy of the pm-changelog settings. The real SDK refused the new Issue with the same twelve missing options and left no item. The fix passes progressive mode and explicit unknown-field deferrals only to create operations under strict tracker defaults. It records the reason in create history for older SDKs and preserves any source assignee.
  "2026-11-17T22:52:32.476Z",codex-sol,The atomic SDK replaces the create history message with its transaction receipt. The importer therefore keeps the deferral reason in an item note for hosts that only support progressive mode. The native 2026.11.17 SDK also persists deferred_fields and pm validate reports them.
  "2026-11-17T22:57:04.397Z",codex-sol,"Compatibility verified with published SDKs. The create option contract is public at the supported 2026.10.23 floor. SDK 2026.11.6 rejects unknown defer options, so the importer checks for defer and deferReason before sending them. The copied pm-changelog settings passed with an item note on 2026.11.6 and four native deferrals in pm validate on 2026.11.17. Under the same SDK and clock, the default tracker produced item and item-history bytes identical to a3a2e7c. Cross-principal assignee ownership is tracked in pm-github-s6xa."
  "2026-11-17T23:09:33.613Z",codex-sol,The deferral regression uses a separate published SDK fixture so the default development and consumer versions stay in place. Raising the default development pin exposed the ownership hook delegation typing issue tracked in pm-github-imvm.
  "2026-11-17T23:18:55.776Z",codex-sol,"Code and fixtures are in f4986eb. Passed npm run typecheck, npm run build, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run docstring, npm run changelog:check and npm run privacy. The targeted node --test run passed across 75 import and affected test files with PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick. The linked node --test test/strict-import-admission.test.ts passed through pm test and separately on Node 22 and Bun. A gated state-all fixture preserved a closed source issue and its completion date. Strict health passed in an isolated clone with its merge drivers installed. Release the claim for review."
  "2026-11-17T23:31:45.968Z",codex-sol,PR 260 Node 22 CI exposed four stale ownership inventory assertions after index.ts shifted. The targeted file filter missed this generated inventory dependency. Regenerated docs/identity-ownership-inventory.md with the repository script and added the inventory test to the linked gates.
  "2026-11-17T23:32:33.782Z",codex-sol,"Ownership inventory generation and check passed. Both linked tests passed through pm test. Node 22 passed all 39 inventory, ownership regression and strict admission tests. The follow-up only refreshes the generated anchors and the tracker evidence."
  "2026-11-18T01:15:01.709Z",codex-sol,Round BN keeps progressive admission so GitHub issues remain mirrored while delivery fields await triage. Add a preflight count and carry the successful gated apply receipt into the sync review and job summary. Document the existing ownership compensation and scale the subprocess harness.
  "2026-11-18T02:17:03.134Z",codex-sol,"Round BN: PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM64tof_ maps to e836b51 for strict preflight and the gated Needs curation report. PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM64togE maps to e836b51 for the mapped-assignee compensation documentation and pm-github-s6xa link. PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM64togK maps to e836b51 for testTime on the subprocess harness. The linked full-depth 69-file gate ran 1801 tests with 1799 passed and two existing SDK compensation skips for pm-cli#1656. Node 22 passed seven strict admission and inventory tests. Build, test build, typecheck, lint, docstring, privacy, inventory, changelog, and duplication passed. The PR description records the design and preserves the existing links."
